; bal -X EUR --unrealized values each posting's cost in euros on its
; transaction's date, or on the terminus when the transaction is dated
; after it, and bal -B -X EUR --unrealized foots as it did before the
; balance report valued postings at cost.
;
; At the earlier report date neither ACME, bought at a virtual cost, which
; records no price, nor MSFT, bought after that date, has a price, so -X
; leaves both in their own commodities and they add nothing to the
; unrealized rows.  The dollars paid for MSFT are valued at the terminus
; rate, EUR0.90, the rate at which the report displays them, and not at
; the EUR0.80 of the purchase, a price later than the report's valuation
; date.  The one unrealized row is then the gain on the AAPL lot, its $1,700
; value less its $1,500 cost at EUR0.90, or EUR180.00; valuing the MSFT
; purchase at EUR0.80 would take EUR30.00 off it.
;
; Under --basis the running total holds the dollar cost of each posting,
; which -X converts at the terminus.  The report can value those dollars
; although it cannot value ACME or MSFT, so each posting is booked at its
; cost and the report foots at both dates.  Testing whether the report can
; value the holding itself, instead of the dollars the posting contributes,
; left the $500 paid for ACME in the baseline at the terminus rate while
; the Checking leg that paid it was valued at the January rate, and printed
; the difference as an unrealized row (EUR-75.00 at the later date).

P 2024/01/01 $ EUR0.90
P 2024/06/01 $ EUR0.80
P 2024/09/01 $ EUR0.75

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL @ $150
    Assets:Checking

2024/01/01 Buy at a virtual cost
    Assets:Private          10 ACME (@) $50
    Assets:Checking

P 2024/03/01 AAPL $170

2024/07/01 Buy after the earlier report date
    Assets:Brokerage        3 MSFT @ $100
    Assets:Checking

test bal -X EUR --unrealized --now 2024/04/01
             10 ACME
          EUR-540.00
              3 MSFT  Assets
          EUR1530.00
              3 MSFT    Brokerage
         EUR-2070.00    Checking
             10 ACME    Private
          EUR-180.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
             10 ACME
          EUR-720.00
              3 MSFT
end test

test bal -B -X EUR --unrealized --now 2024/04/01
                   0  Assets
          EUR1620.00    Brokerage
         EUR-2070.00    Checking
           EUR450.00    Private
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal -B -X EUR --unrealized --now 2024/12/01
                   0  Assets
          EUR1350.00    Brokerage
         EUR-1725.00    Checking
           EUR375.00    Private
--------------------
                   0
end test
